Description: Removable drives with eject controls (DECKSMITHOS_DRIVES)
 DECKSMITHOS_DRIVES="/usb:/usb2" lists fixed mount points of removable
 drives; per drive n: [Drives],mounted_<n> (1 while a drive is mounted
 there, polled every second), [Drives],eject_<n> and [Drives],eject_error_<n>.
 Eject unloads the tracks from that drive from stopped players (refused,
 with eject_error, while one of them plays), then runs
 DECKSMITHOS_EJECT_COMMAND with the mount point (DecksmithOS: sudo -n
 decksmithos-system eject, which unmounts and detaches the disk). For a skin
 EJECT button on an appliance without a desktop. Without the variable
 nothing changes.
Author: DecksmithOS
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-22
